## Designing of multifunctional and flame retardant separator towards safer high-performance lithium-sulfur batteries
Junling Wang<sup>1,2</sup>, Wei Cai<sup>1</sup>, Xiaowei Mu<sup>1</sup>, Longfei Han<sup>1</sup>, Na Wu<sup>1</sup>, Can Liao<sup>1</sup>, Yongchun Kan<sup>1</sup> (✉), and Yuan Hu<sup>1</sup> (✉)
<sup>1</sup> State Key Laboratory of Fire Science, CAS Key Laboratory of Soft Matter Chemistry, University of Science and Technology of China, Hefei 230026, China  <sup>2</sup> Jiangsu Key Laboratory of Hazardous Chemicals Safety and Control, College of Safety Science and Engineering, Nanjing Tech University, Nanjing 211816, China
